1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:02,460
(Sheldon:)Good morning.

2
00:00:03,668 --> 00:00:05,668
ALL:
Good morning.

3
00:00:05,878 --> 00:00:07,458
(Leonard:)Sheldon, sit down.

4
00:00:08,089 --> 00:00:09,129
(Sheldon:)She's in my spot.

5
00:00:12,218 --> 00:00:15,218
(Sheldon:)Don't look at me like that.
Everybody knows that's my spot.

6
00:00:20,476 --> 00:00:21,856
(Scene:)Sheldon...

7
00:00:22,019 --> 00:00:24,399
...you know that we care about you.

8
00:00:24,564 --> 00:00:28,354
(Howard:)And it's because we care about you
that we've decided we have to speak up.

9
00:00:33,322 --> 00:00:35,412
(Penny:)You're hurting the people
around you, sweetie.

10
00:00:35,575 --> 00:00:39,205
(Leonard:)So we made you an appointment,
and we want you to keep it.

11
00:00:40,871 --> 00:00:44,251
"Department of Motor Vehicles
New Driver Handbook"?

12
00:00:48,004 --> 00:00:50,174
(Sheldon:)But I don't have a problem.

13
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:54,020
(Leonard:)Sheldon, you need to learn how to drive.

